s=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay Island (Snowlands)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"NPC\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">NPC</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Gizmo</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Purpose\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Purpose</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Purchasing mid-game to late-game items.</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.71.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">December 1st, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>Gizmo's Observatory is a shop located in the <a href=\"/wiki/Snowlands\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snowlands\">Snowlands</a>. It is primarily accessible through taking a <a href=\"/wiki/Snowdrift_Station_A_%26_B\" title=\"Snowdrift Station A &amp; B\">cable car</a> available up the hill when entering the <a href=\"/wiki/Snowlands\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snowlands\">Snowlands</a>. It is owned by <a href=\"/wiki/Gizmo\" title=\"Gizmo\">Gizmo</a>.  \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes:\">Notes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>It is required to pull both book levers on the first floor of the observatory in order to open up the trapdoor located in the back to purchase the <a href=\"/wiki/Flamethrower\" title=\"Flamethrower\">Flamethrower</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Metal_Detector\" title=\"Metal Detector\">Metal Detector</a>.\n<ul><li>The first book lever is located under the fallen book cabinet and the second is on the top shelf of the standing books cabinet next to the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Winter Breeze Vinyl (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvV2ludGVyX0JyZWV6ZV9WaW55bD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Winter Breeze</span> vinyl.</li></ul></li>\n<li>If you want to get to the 2nd floor you will need a <a href=\"/wiki/Lab_Card\" title=\"Lab Card\">Lab Card</a>. From there, you want to put it on the key card swiper so you can get to the second floor to buy the <a href=\"/wiki/Red_Keycard\" title=\"Red Keycard\">Red Keycard</a> and <span class=\"new\" title=\"Cozy Cabin Vinyl (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ296eV9DYWJpbl9WaW55bD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Cozy Cabin Vinyl</span>.</li>\n<li>There are two music vinyls in the Observatory. <span class=\"new\" title=\"Winter Breeze Vinyl (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvV2ludGVyX0JyZWV6ZV9WaW55bD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Winter Breeze</span> is on the first floor and the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Cozy Cabin Vinyl (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ296eV9DYWJpbl9WaW55bD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Cozy Cabin</span> on the second.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inventory\">Inventory</span></h2>\n<p>This table shows all items available at the store.\n</p>\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible fandom-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Meteor_Telescope\" title=\"Meteor Telescope\">Meteor Telescope</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d8/Meteor_Telescope_.png/revision/latest?cb=20241212180642\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Meteor Telescope \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d8/Meteor_Telescope_.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241212180642\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"111\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Meteor Telescope .png\" data-image-key=\"Meteor_Telescope_.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$150,160\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Weather_Radar\" title=\"Weather Radar\">Weather Radar</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a1/Weather_Radar.png/revision/latest?cb=20241212180755\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Weather Radar\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a1/Weather_Radar.png/revision/latest?cb=20241212180755\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"138\" height=\"359\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Weather Radar.png\" data-image-key=\"Weather_Radar.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$90,670\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Sled\" title=\"Sled\">Sled</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/11/Sledred.png/revision/latest?cb=20250309175732\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Sledred\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/11/Sledred.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250309175732\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"95\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Sledred.png\" data-image-key=\"Sledred.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>$1,400\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Red_Keycard\" title=\"Red Keycard\">Observatory Keycard</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dc/Observatory_Card.png/revision/latest?cb=20241208195007\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Observatory Card\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"152\" height=\"82\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Observatory Card.png\" data-image-key=\"Observatory_Card.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dc/Observatory_Card.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/152?cb=20241208195007\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$50,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Metal_Detector\" title=\"Metal Detector\">Metal Detector</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e1/Metal.png/revision/latest?cb=20241212180406\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Metal\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Metal.png\" data-image-key=\"Metal.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e1/Metal.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241212180406\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$32,500\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Flamethrower\" title=\"Flamethrower\">Flamethrower</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a6/BoxedFlameThrower.png/revision/latest?cb=20241207184748\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"BoxedFlameThrower\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"81\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"BoxedFlameThrower.png\" data-image-key=\"BoxedFlameThrower.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a6/BoxedFlameThrower.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241207184748\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$323,420\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Other info: there are two music disks in the observatory. One on the first and One on the second floor. The disks are \"cozy cabin\" and \"winter breeze\".\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902170215\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 67/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019469/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.318      1 Template:Buildings\n100.00%   30.318      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3623-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902170215 and revision id 18150. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Flamethrower","exists":true},{"title":"Gizmo","exists":true},{"title":"Lab Card","exists":true},{"title":"Metal Detector","exists":true},{"title":"Meteor Telescope","exists":true},